<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells ferro-chrome to Macalloy.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells ferro-chrome to Macalloy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 16,883 short tons of high carbon ferro-chrome to Macalloy Corp of North Charleston, SC, for an approximate provisional value of $11.2 million.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
